  "id": "cognitive-operation",
  "term": "cognitive operation",
  "definition": "A cognitive operation is an intellectual mental act involved in grasping concepts and the relationships between them. In the source, this idea is contrasted with embodied understanding, which includes sensory, motor, and emotional processes rather than only abstract thought.",
